A '''medical bay'''<ref name="Confined AD" /> was located in the [[Tantiss Base]] on [[Mount Tantiss]], where [[Emerie Karr]], assistant to [[Imperial cloning program]] chief [[Royce Hemlock]], collected the [[blood]] of [[clone trooper]]s imprisoned in the facility to [[Central lab|test]] for successful m-count integration. It was arranged in a circular shape, with two secure antechambers in each side and guarded by [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[clone commando]]s. Inside the lab were four beds where clone troopers lied for their blood to be collected by [[Imperial nanny droid|medical droids]], and a central [[computer]] console where the samples were analyzed.<ref name="Confined" />

